[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0527","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0527.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0675","title":"Infopulse GateKeeper 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Infopulse GateKeeper 3.5 及更早版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 GateKeeper 服务发送超长字符串触发缓冲区溢出，导致任意命令执行。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击门槛较低，成功利用后可完全控制受影响系统，危害严重。受影响版本包括 GateKeeper 3.5 及之前的所有版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0675"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-07-13T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:14.593","remediation":"立即升级 Infopulse GateKeeper 至 3.6 或更高版本（3.5 及更早版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞）。如厂商已不再提供更新支持，建议迁移至其他受支持的远程访问控制方案。临时缓解措施：在防火墙层面限制对 GateKeeper 服务端口（默认 8123/TCP）的访问，仅允许可信 IP 来源连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1477","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=00af01bfece2%24a52cbd80%24367e1ec4%40kungphusion","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4948","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20074","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fbe4faa82ea56a60f688d9bd92ecf2ac8f256a8a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0675.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0675","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0675.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5c6904371163d9b81521151d4181001adee1b956/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0675.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2f2b600b6067347440c628428f80fe3f9e3c004e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2gq8-wr55-679w/GHSA-2gq8-wr55-679w.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0675.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--8352fded-636f-4db1-929c-491d4f250e67.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0527.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0501","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0501.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0649","title":"Microsoft IIS 内部IP地址泄露漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 4.0 存在内部 IP 地址泄露漏洞。当受基本身份验证保护且未定义 realm 域的网页收到 HTTP 1.0 请求时，服务器会在响应中泄露内部 IP 地址。远程攻击者可利用此漏洞获取目标服务器的内部网络信息，为进一步攻击收集情报。该漏洞影响 IIS 2.0/3.0/4.0/5.0/5.1 版本，CVSS 评分 2.6，危害等级低。建议升级至更高版本或安装厂商安全补丁进行修复。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0649"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-07-13T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:11.267","remediation":"立即升级至受支持的 IIS 版本（如 Windows Server 2012 R2+ 的 IIS 8.5 或 Windows Server 2016+ 的 IIS 10.0），这些版本不受此漏洞影响。如无法升级，在 IIS 管理器中为基本身份验证配置明确的领域名称（realm）；安装 URLScan 工具并配置规则，拒绝缺少 Host 头的 HTTP 1.0 请求。在防火墙或反向代理层面过滤响应中泄露的内网 IP 地址作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2000-q3/0025.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1499","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20096","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0649.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/a787519a95f62cf00a76124a68ca5cfb2e26b6ec/2000/CVE-2000-0649.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/dc4a87067238e8e55e5d3f9777b54558310f6d6e/2000/CVE-2000-0649/cve-2000-0649.py","https://github.com/0xhav0c/FastVulnVerify/blob/1b2f1024e950cdb2820b3fca11e68f84dab87d26/exploits/CVE-2000-0649.py","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0649","https://github.com/ycdxsb/PocOrExp_in_Github/blob/7af8f5cba0896b54f05a0770c724d58dea523d24/2000/README.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7f33768789fe75b3288b56f0d11b0df1d5f4a5d4/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0649.json","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/diannaofengzi/POC/blob/14d504f7488db9229f6f02be54aab53e3cfee0dc/databases/2000/database/CVE-2000-0649/CVE-2000-0649-rafaelh.md","https://github.com/xqx12/daily-info/blob/f89413f27063960293cde4e697eb944bfe558859/2021/tech_info_20210215.md","https://github.com/rafaelh/CVE-2000-0649","https://github.com/Downgraderz/PoC-CVE-2000-0649","https://github.com/stevenvegar/cve-2000-0649"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0501.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0829","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0829.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0674","title":"Virtual Visions FTP浏览器 ftp.pl CGI程序目录遍历漏洞","description":"Virtual Visions FTP 浏览器中的 ftp.pl CGI 程序存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送特制的包含 `..`（点点）序列的 HTTP 请求，绕过文档根目录限制读取服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞利用了程序对用户输入路径过滤不严的问题，攻击者无需身份认证即可实施攻击。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0674"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-07-12T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:14.467","remediation":"对 ftp.pl 脚本中的 path 参数进行输入过滤，严格禁止包含 ../ 或 ..\\ 等目录跳转序列，可使用正则校验只允许字母数字和下划线组成的路径；或将脚本升级至厂商修补后的版本；如软件已停止维护，建议直接禁用或替换该 CGI 脚本，改用其他更安全的 FTP 浏览方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0177.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1471","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5187","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fbe4faa82ea56a60f688d9bd92ecf2ac8f256a8a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0674.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0674","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0674.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5c6904371163d9b81521151d4181001adee1b956/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0674.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e38df7a80f8aa0122f9b0f7f660a5a952c979cc6/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-893w-6f8w-fqc2/GHSA-893w-6f8w-fqc2.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/ftp_pl.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0674.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--74fadc29-2152-4705-a76d-cb3850b0b395.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0829.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0781","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0781.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0643","title":"WebActive HTTP Server 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"WebActive HTTP Server 1.00 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需认证即可向目标服务器发送超长 URL 请求，触发缓冲区溢出，导致 WebActive HTTP Server 进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 WebActive HTTP Server 1.00 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。受影响的系统管理员应限制对 HTTP 服务的访问或升级至修复版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0643"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-07-12T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:10.477","remediation":"建议立即停止使用 WebActive HTTP Server 1.00，该产品已停止维护且不再提供安全更新。将服务迁移至 Nginx 或 Apache HTTP Server 等仍在积极维护的现代 Web 服务器。如无法立即迁移，可在反向代理或 WAF 层面配置规则，限制传入 URL 长度不超过 1024 字节，以缓解缓冲区溢出导致的拒绝服务风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1470","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=200007130827.BAA32671%40Rage.Resentment.org","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4949","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ad6ba3d27513a57837704589c10c0be969a18efd/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0643.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0643","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0643.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1d32b25dbea4bacedc1131a8702fa8adcc181eee/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0643.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/dc4a87067238e8e55e5d3f9777b54558310f6d6e/2000/CVE-2000-0649/cve-2000-0649.py","https://github.com/0xhav0c/FastVulnVerify/blob/1b2f1024e950cdb2820b3fca11e68f84dab87d26/exploits/CVE-2000-0649.py","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0643.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0781.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0781.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0780","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0780.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0642","title":"WebActive HTTP Server 日志信息泄露漏洞","description":"WebActive HTTP Server 1.00 默认配置将 Web 访问日志文件 active.log 存储在网站文档根目录下，导致远程攻击者可通过直接请求该日志文件路径的方式获取服务器访问记录。该漏洞属于信息泄露类型，攻击者无需认证即可利用日志中可能包含的敏感信息（如管理员 IP、请求路径、Cookie 等）进行进一步攻击。影响范围限于使用 WebActive HTTP Server 1.00 默认配置的 Web 服务器。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0642"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-07-12T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:10.350","remediation":"将 WebActive HTTP Server 的日志目录移出文档根目录（DocumentRoot），修改配置文件中的日志路径至 Web 根目录之外的目录（如 /var/log/webactive/），并对日志目录设置严格的访问权限（700），同时通过 .htaccess 或服务器配置禁止直接访问 .log 后缀文件。由于该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至主流受支持的 Web 服务器（如 Apache HTTP Server 或 Nginx）以彻底消除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1497","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=200007130827.BAA32671%40Rage.Resentment.org","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5184","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ad6ba3d27513a57837704589c10c0be969a18efd/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0642.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0642","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0642.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1d32b25dbea4bacedc1131a8702fa8adcc181eee/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0642.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d34115c5df8a79b3a76d7097ef910b9992c9ee85/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-52p2-82rj-4r39/GHSA-52p2-82rj-4r39.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/webactive_log.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0642.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--e6fa196a-cab4-4aa3-8633-113293ffee80.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/3f03bd7f1d1606d853ca070d5f0897c51e140c86/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0780.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0780.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0763","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0763.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0629","title":"Sun Java System Web Server 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"该漏洞存在于 Sun Java web server 2.0 及更早版本的默认配置中。这些版本允许攻击者上传 Java 代码到服务器，通过 `board.html` 界面直接调用 JSP 编译器servlet来执行任意命令，从而完全控制目标服务器。该漏洞影响早期Java网络服务器产品，攻击者无需任何权限即可远程利用这一漏洞。攻击者首先通过web界面上传恶意Java源代码，然后利用系统的JSP编译功能来执行这些代码，没有安全验证机制。这导致攻击者能够在目标服务器上执行任意命令，窃取敏感数据、破坏系统或利用该漏洞进一步攻击内部网络。 CVSS评分7.5表明该漏洞的安全影响较严重。尽管该漏洞已非常古老，但它体现了一个基本的Web应用安全原则：应用服务器不应允许未经授权的代码上传和直接编译执行的默认行为。攻击者可以轻易地在目标系统上建立后门，或利用上传的恶意代码进行数据窃取或系统破坏。该漏洞提醒开发者应严格限制代码上传和执行的权限，即使在开发或测试环境中也不应允许这种直接的代码执行机制存在。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0629"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-07-12T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:08.707","remediation":"立即迁移至 Apache Tomcat 10.1 / Jetty 12 / Undertow 等现代 Servlet 容器；若必须维持旧环境，立即删除 webapps/ROOT/board.html 并删除/禁用 JSP 编译 Servlet（jspc/servlet），在防火墙层面禁止外部访问管理端口与文件上传目录，并部署 WAF 规则拦截 .jsp/.java 上传请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-26T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0163.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1459","http://www.sun.com/software/jwebserver/faq/jwsca-2000-02.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5a47a98d3cbc3520c61de6e48feeb4ac3ff1959f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0629.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0629","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/660abd3ba8b9665b75517f5af32be5415f0c15ce/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0629.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d32e0b640af59eb0eaf607a7942d5c2c21e6e8c6/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0629.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/6be15d5bc4d11c3f9dbcc76b2b68361cadc22974/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3987-59ph-j5q3/GHSA-3987-59ph-j5q3.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/a1f8b3e954dc569a9faaf2d530236d865bca3340/content/CVE-2000-0629.md","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/bboard.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0629.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0763.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0763.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0763.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0524","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0524.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0670","title":"CVSWeb Developer CVSWeb 1.80 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"CVSWeb 1.80 中的 cvsweb CGI 脚本存在不安全的 Perl `open` 函数调用漏洞，具有 CVS 仓库写入权限的远程攻击者可通过向 `open` 函数传递包含 shell 元字符的特制参数，触发命令注入漏洞，进而导致在目标服务器上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 CVSWeb 1.80 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0670"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-07-12T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:13.950","remediation":"升级 CVSWeb 至 2.0 及以上版本，该版本已修复 Perl open() 函数中 shell 元字符未过滤的问题。如无法升级，建议迁移至 ViewVC 替代方案，并在 CVS 服务器上配置严格的文件路径白名单，限制 CGI 脚本对 repository 路径的写入权限。同时在 Web 服务器层面过滤传入参数中的特殊字符（如 |、;、` 等）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0178.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0196.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1469","http://www.turbolinux.com/pipermail/tl-security-announce/2000-August/000015.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4925","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20073","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2d894f23944bb9acf861e3c6e192d8f723b95560/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0670.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0670","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0670.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/97b4cb3f61e03100104d7050d5d2fad3d3489e66/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0670.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/37358611606378c1ef62b2ed4e6b7dfbe11dca04/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-hwh6-7mhj-rx77/GHSA-hwh6-7mhj-rx77.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/sid-msg.map","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/C/cvsweb_shell.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/slacker247/GPDA/blob/fa9006d0877a691f1ddffe88799c844a3e8a669a/Sodi/Run/IDSrules/rule.826","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0670.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0524.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0524.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0524.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0513","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0513.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0660","title":"alt-n WorldClient 目录遍历漏洞","description":"alt-N WorldClient Standard 2.1 内置的 WDaemon Web 服务器存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向服务器发送包含 `..`（点点）序列的恶意 HTTP 请求，突破路径限制，读取服务器上的任意敏感文件，如配置文件与系统文件等。该漏洞影响 WorldClient Standard 2.1 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。建议用户升级至更高版本或限制 Web 服务器的文件访问权限以降低风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0660"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-07-12T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:12.680","remediation":"升级到 WorldClient 2.1.1 或更高版本（包含在 MDaemon 3.1.1 及以上版本中）。该补丁在 WDaemon 的 URL 路径解析中增加了对 ..\\ 和 ../ 目录遍历序列的过滤校验。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理或 Web 应用防火墙层面配置规则，拦截 URL 中包含 ..\\ 或 ../ 的请求，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0173.html","http://www.altn.com/Downloads/WorldClient/Release/RelNotes.txt","http://www.osvdb.org/1459","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1462","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4913","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20070","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0660.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3d8ee18720c8a74c03524a9994e81b2de7f6b0ec/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0660.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0660","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4dd512046a74ddd9ae16741caf0933056ffd666e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0660.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0660.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/5113e9b43f598fb5a0e0333780445658279ab459/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-r4c5-4hcj-q3cc/GHSA-r4c5-4hcj-q3cc.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/worldclient_server_detection.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0660.json","https://github.com/akabe1/windows_exploit_dowser/blob/11b24e36173cd382721db28581e575faf687d06b/cve_from_exploitdb_website.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0513.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0388","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0388.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0372","title":"Caldera dump 软件包 rmt 命令本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Caldera 系统中 dump 软件包 0.4b4 版本所包含的 rmt 命令存在本地权限提升漏洞。由于 rmt 命令在处理特定操作时未正确限制权限，本地攻击者可通过执行特制的 rmt 命令获取系统 root 权限，从而完全控制目标系统。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证，但需要本地访问权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0372"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-12T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:34.767","remediation":"立即升级 Caldera OpenLinux 系统中的 dump 软件包至高于 0.4b4 的版本，该补丁已由 Caldera 在安全公告 CSSA-1999-014 中发布。如无法升级，可移除 rmt 命令的 setuid 权限（chmod u-s /sbin/rmt），并限制仅受信任用户可执行 dump/restore 操作。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/7940","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2268","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0372.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0372","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0372.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0372.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/9119295a984ba3fccef08b7eec3fc9b62b1da974/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-53f7-wgp3-4g8x/GHSA-53f7-wgp3-4g8x.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88336/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0372.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--e797f8a9-e581-4a43-b104-035739f7e402.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0388.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0791","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0791.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0654","title":"Microsoft Enterprise Manager DTS 密码信息泄露漏洞","description":"Microsoft Enterprise Manager 的数据转换服务（DTS）包中的\"已注册服务器对话\"对话框存在密码泄露漏洞。本地用户可通过该对话框以明文方式获取数据库连接密码，导致敏感凭据泄露。攻击者需具有本地系统访问权限，利用该漏洞可进一步扩大数据库访问控制范围。该漏洞属于\" DTS 密码\"漏洞的变种，影响 Microsoft SQL Server 相关组件，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0654"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-07-11T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:11.880","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-041 提供的 SQL Server 7.0 DTS 密码修补程序（下载地址：https://download.microsoft.com/download/sql70/DTSPWFix/7.0/WIN98/EN-US/DTSUIi.exe）；使用 Windows 身份验证替代 SQL Server 身份验证以存储 DTS 包密码；限制 MSDB 数据库的 Guest 访问权限，仅授予 DTS 包所有者编辑权限；遵循最小权限原则，不为 DTS 包使用系统管理员账户。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1466","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-041","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4582","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/72f387512fbbb3f0e46713b23cdbd1f9c533d1f7/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0654.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0654","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0654.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d67487551d3c04e5942b9b8e11c25937ecfba21c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0654.json","https://github.com/dependency-check/DependencyCheck/blob/7dcfc0737c21744b423c2198ae979003c2eb67e2/core/src/main/resources/dependencycheck-base-suppression.xml","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/0xxx/cve-2000-0654.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/bc3b224aa865bb4a5c31d7720dca83e446e475e2/2000/CVE-2000-0654.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/dong-xs/Vul-PAG/blob/7eb3b32094a5270cfd8495366e0e4a7df5a874ce/aspect_prediction/org_pred_diff.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0791.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0788","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0788.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0650","title":"McAfee VirusScan 和 NetShield AutoUpgrade 目录权限许可漏洞","description":"McAfee VirusScan 4.5 和 NetShield 4.5 默认安装过程中为标识 AutoUpgrade 目录的注册表项设置了不安全的权限，导致本地低权限用户可将该目录中原有的 SETUP.EXE 替换为特洛伊木马程序。当系统执行自动升级时，木马即以高权限运行，从而实现本地权限提升或任意命令执行。该漏洞攻击前提为攻击者已获得本地访问权限，利用难度较低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0650"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-07-11T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:11.383","remediation":"立即将 VirusScan/NetShield 升级至 4.5 以上官方最新版本，该版本已修复 AutoUpgrade 注册表项（`HKLM\\Software\\Network Associates\\TVD\\VirusScan\\AutoUpgrade`）权限配置问题。如无法升级，手动收紧该注册表项权限：使用 `regedit` 将该项的 ACL 修改为仅允许 Administrators 和 SYSTEM 完全控制，移除 Users/Everyone 组的写入权限。同时建议启用 Windows 组策略限制非管理员对本机注册表的写入操作作为纵深防御。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.ntbugtraq.com/default.asp?pid=36&sid=1&A2=ind0007&L=ntbugtraq&F=&S=&P=2753","http://www.osvdb.org/1458","http://www.osvdb.org/4200","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1458","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5177","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7f33768789fe75b3288b56f0d11b0df1d5f4a5d4/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0650.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0650","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0650.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d67487551d3c04e5942b9b8e11c25937ecfba21c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0650.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/32e7885f9dd6f50edc2a4b9aee21e32f55f76f84/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-25pv-5r6h-55j6/GHSA-25pv-5r6h-55j6.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/bc3b224aa865bb4a5c31d7720dca83e446e475e2/2000/CVE-2000-0650.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--e0b785d0-9396-4122-8fa8-a7b2a08d145e.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/5116d66f715b098d7dc74f3fb3559215242e5dbf/2000.tsv","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--e0b785d0-9396-4122-8fa8-a7b2a08d145e.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0788.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0760","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0760.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0628","title":"Apache Apache::ASP source.asp 任意文件写入漏洞","description":"Apache::ASP 模块 1.93 及更早版本中自带的 source.asp 示例脚本存在文件非法写入漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向该脚本发送特制 HTTP 请求，利用脚本中的安全缺陷在目标服务器上任意修改文件，导致系统完整性受损。该漏洞影响 Apache::ASP 1.93 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。目前官方已建议移除或限制 source.asp 脚本的访问权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0628"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-07-11T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:08.580","remediation":"升级 Apache::ASP 至 2.0 或更高版本，或直接删除 web 根目录下的 `source.asp` 示例脚本。如无法立即升级，在 Apache 配置中将该文件所在目录添加 `Deny from all` 访问限制作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-26T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0142.html","http://www.nodeworks.com/asp/changes.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1457","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4931","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f0e93dd3ef2d8235c938c56855c95925193ef4eb/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0628.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0628","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/581b673c344d829d047fea0ed051c916f949df9f/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0628.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e7775058398ca808720ec1cde94e510312238d06/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0628.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c94c1772ba718b7f105ed32361c896b35042b2b3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9mpp-c9vq-p5h7/GHSA-9mpp-c9vq-p5h7.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/apache_source_asp.nasl","https://github.com/NetBSD/pkgsrc-wip/blob/46809ccdbe8670cfc7e2bea489de1ee608ba520e/sara/PLIST","https://github.com/ivanitlearning/CTF-Repos/blob/b5364388a861fc7457409d494a9d075d73e7867e/Vulnhub/SkyTower/Web-scan.txt","https://github.com/slacker247/GPDA/blob/fa9006d0877a691f1ddffe88799c844a3e8a669a/Sodi/Run/IDSrules/rule.1125","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0760.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0760.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0760.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0523","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0523.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0669","title":"Novell NetWare 5.0 SMDR.NLM 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Novell NetWare 5.0 的 SMDR.NLM 模块存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标系统的 40193 端口发送大量随机数据包，导致 SMDR 服务因无法正确处理异常流量而崩溃，造成目标系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Novell NetWare 5.0 SP5 及 6.0 SP1 版本，攻击手段简单，利用难度低，目前已有公开的 PoC 验证代码。官方尚未发布补丁，建议通过访问控制限制 40193 端口的访问。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0669"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-07-11T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:13.830","remediation":"安装 Novell NetWare 5.0 最新支持包（Support Pack 6 及后续累积补丁），或在服务器控制台执行 UNLOAD SMDR.NLM 卸载该模块（如 SMDR 服务非必需）。在网络层面于边界防火墙阻断对 TCP 40193 端口的入站访问，限制仅受信任管理网段可连接。鉴于 NetWare 5.0 已停止技术支持，建议尽快迁移至受支持的现代平台。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1467","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=000501bfeab5%249330c3d0%24d801a8c0%40dimuthu.baysidegrp.com.au","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20072","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2d894f23944bb9acf861e3c6e192d8f723b95560/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0669.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0669","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0669.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/97b4cb3f61e03100104d7050d5d2fad3d3489e66/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0669.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/37358611606378c1ef62b2ed4e6b7dfbe11dca04/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2mg2-8p2q-47h9/GHSA-2mg2-8p2q-47h9.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0669.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0523.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0499","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0499.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0648","title":"Texas Imperial Software WFTPD 2.4.1 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Texas Imperial Software WFTPD 2.41 及 WFTPD Pro 2.41 存在拒绝服务漏洞。攻击者可通过先发送 RENAME TO（RNTO）命令再发送 RENAME FROM（RNFR）命令触发协议处理异常，导致 FTP 服务崩溃。该漏洞源于程序对命令序列的错误处理，未正确校验 RNTO 执行前是否已执行 RNFR。利用该漏洞需具备本地系统访问权限，攻击条件较为受限，但一旦成功将造成 FTP 服务不可用，影响文件传输功能正常运作。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0648"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-07-11T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:11.140","remediation":"立即将 WFTPD 升级至 2.41 以上版本（如 3.00+），该版本已修复 RNTO 命令在 RNFR 之前执行导致的崩溃问题。由于 Texas Imperial Software 已停止更新维护，建议迁移至其他活跃维护的 FTP 服务器软件（如 FileZilla Server、vsftpd 等）。若暂时无法迁移，可在防火墙和主机层面限制 FTP 服务的访问来源 IP，仅允许受信任的用户连接，并配置 FTP 服务器的超时和连接限制参数以降低 DoS 影响。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1456","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=E13BvU6-0007d8-00%40dwarf.box.sk","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20069","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7f33768789fe75b3288b56f0d11b0df1d5f4a5d4/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0648.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0648","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0648.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d67487551d3c04e5942b9b8e11c25937ecfba21c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0648.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ab96f9177ee90a5f19d09110efe1f64b34e91053/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-99c8-6rr7-v77j/GHSA-99c8-6rr7-v77j.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/W/wftp_dos.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0648.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1456/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0499.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0489","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0489.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0638","title":"Big Brother bb-hostsvc.sh 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Big Brother 监控系统 1.4h1 及更早版本中的 bb-hostsvc.sh 脚本存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过在 HOSTSVC 参数中构造 `../` 序列进行路径穿越，从而读取服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞利用难度较低，影响范围广泛。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0638"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-07-11T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:09.860","remediation":"升级 Big Brother 至 1.4h2 或更高版本以修复目录遍历漏洞。如无法升级，修改 bb-hostsvc.sh 脚本，对 HOSTSVC 参数做输入过滤，拒绝包含 `../` 或绝对路径的请求；同时在 Web 服务器层限制对 bb-hostsvc.sh 的访问来源 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0146.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0147.html","http://bb4.com/README.CHANGES","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1455","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4879","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20068","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4382b0b8593e7ef30616ab300314afbbf1571636/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0638.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0638","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/8854c056beab250ba690e2bcc8887feb4c1f8139/2000/CVE-2000-0638/README.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0638.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cae595683b6fe65324ec717750e7cdca928c1db7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0638.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/bb-hostsvc.nasl","https://github.com/NetBSD/pkgsrc-wip/blob/aad0c565cec09d12eb0b48174d0da4caa60411fd/sara/PLIST","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/snort/drop-rules/web-cgi.rules"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0489.toml"}]